tab apps | Apps | apps

sub services | Services & presets

tweak win.svcpreset | dns | rec reboot
  name  Service preset
  desc  Turns off Windows services you do not use. Light only stops telemetry and diagnostics. Balanced also stops legacy, remote, sync and mixed-reality services. Extreme also stops remote management, network discovery, backup, smart card, legacy port and per-user sync services, but keeps everything a normal PC relies on (clipboard, notifications, Start, Bluetooth pairing, BitLocker, ISO mounting, file sharing, VPN, screen capture), so it stays stable. Default puts back the Windows start types.
  opt   default | Windows default
  RESET
  opt   light | Light
  SVCS  2 | Schedule:2 EventLog:2 RpcSs:2 RpcEptMapper:2 DcomLaunch:2 Winmgmt:2 LanmanWorkstation:2 NlaSvc:2 netprofm:3 NcbService:3 RmSvc:3 WlanSvc:2 Wcmsvc:2 Dnscache:2 Dhcp:2 condrv:3
  SVCS  3 | VSS:3 wmiApSrv:3
  SVCS  4 | DiagTrack:2 dmwappushservice:3 diagnosticshub.standardcollector.service:3 RetailDemo:3 WdiSystemHost:3 WdiServiceHost:3 troubleshootingsvc:3 diagsvc:3 InventorySvc:3 wisvc:3 PcaSvc:3 DusmSvc:2 WSAIFabricSvc:2 svsvc:3 wercplsupport:3 WerSvc:3
  opt   balanced | Balanced
  USE   light
  SVCS  4 | SysMain:2 AJRouter:3 CertPropSvc:3 Browser:3 TrkWks:2 EntAppSvc:3 lfsvc:3 Mcx2Svc:4 CscService:3 WpcMonSvc:3 PNRPsvc:3 RemoteRegistry:4 RemoteAccess:4 TapiSrv:3 WMPNetworkSvc:3 MessagingService:3 shpamsvc:4
  SVCS  4 | UCPD dam GpuEnergyDrv NetBT tcpipreg:2 MSDTC:3 SmsRouter:3 UserDataSvc:3 UnistoreSvc:3 PimIndexMaintenanceSvc:3 perceptionsimulation:3 SpatialGraphFilter:3 SharedRealitySvc:3 MixedRealityOpenXRSvc:3
  SVCS  4 | Wecsvc:3 SEMgrSvc:3 Fax:3 autotimesvc:3 DialogBlockingService:4 tzautoupdate:3 MsKeyboardFilter:4 NetTcpPortSharing:4 MSiSCSI:3 SCPolicySvc:3 IpxlatCfgSvc:3 AxInstSV:3 AppVClient:4 DcpSvc:3
  SVCS  4 | p2psvc:3 p2pimsvc:3 AppIDSvc:3 KtmRm:3 PeerDistSvc:3 RasAcd:3 RasAuto:3 AssignedAccessManagerSvc:3 UmRdpService:3 WarpJITSvc:3 NvTelemetryContainer:2 DSAService:2 SSDPSRV:3
  SVCS  4 | DsSvc:3 DPS:2 Ndu:2 midisrv:3 Beep:1 gupdatem:3 MozillaMaintenance:3 AdobeARMservice:2
  SVCS  3 | GraphicsPerfSvc:3
  SVCS  4 | spectrum:3 VacSvc:3
  opt   extreme | Extreme
  USE   balanced
  SVCS  4 | ALG:3 SDRSVC:3 QWAVE:3 PhoneSvc:3 cloudidsvc:3 CloudBackupRestoreSvc:3 fhsvc:3 wbengine:3 NvContainerNetworkService:3 WinRM:3
  SVCS  4 | lms dsaupdateservice appvvemgr hidir usbcir rdpbus synth3dvsc
  SVCS  4 | WebClient:3 FDResPub:3 upnphost:3 ADPSvc:3 AppMgmt:3 dcsvc:3 DmEnrollmentSvc:3 lltdsvc:3 NaturalAuthentication:3 PerfHost:3 pla:3 sstpsvc:3 wlpasvc:3
  SVCS  4 | SCardSvr:3 ScDeviceEnum:3 srv cdfs wcnfs sgrmbroker PNRPAutoReg:3 RpcLocator:3 SNMPTrap:3 ssh-agent:4 WiaRpc:3 wcncsvc:3
  SVCS  4 | TieringEngineService:3 UevAgentService:4 workfolderssvc:3 WidgetUserService SharedPC:4 ErrDev scfilter RDPDR RdpVideominiport terminpt TsUsbFlt TsUsbGD tsusbhub lltdio rspndr MsLldp NdisCap
  SVCS  4 | Filetrace VerifierExt circlass CSC amdfendr amdfendrmgr LocalKdc refsdedupsvc hpatchmon McmSvc WManSvc MSRDC-Infrastructure lmhosts:3
  SVCS  4 | serial serenum sermouse fdc flpydisk sfloppy
  SVCS  4 | AarSvc:3 AarSvc_* icssvc:3
  SVCS  4 | OneSyncSvc_* MessagingService_* PimIndexMaintenanceSvc_* webthreatdefusersvc_* BcastDVRUserService_* GraphicsPerfSvc_* SmsRouterSvc_*
  SVCS  3 | CDPSvc:2 LanmanServer:2
  STOPDISABLED
  T     disable \Microsoft\Windows\WindowsBackup\ConfigNotification
  T     disable \Microsoft\Windows\WindowsBackup\AutomaticBackup
  T     disable \Microsoft\Windows\User Profile Service\HiveUploadTask
  T     disable \Microsoft\Windows\SideShow\
  T     disable \Microsoft\Windows\Ras\MobilityManager
  T     disable \Microsoft\Windows\NetCfg\BindingWorkItemQueueHandler
  T     disable \Microsoft\Windows\MUI\LPRemove
  T     disable \Microsoft\Windows\Mobile Broadband Accounts\MNO Metadata Parser
