tweak win.sysmain | cached | rec
  name  SysMain service off
  desc  Stops the SysMain (Superfetch) service that preloads apps into memory. Use with Memory > Prefetch & SysMain.
  SVCS  4 | SysMain:2

tweak win.searchsvc | manage_search
  name  Search indexer service off
  desc  Stops the Windows Search indexer. Searching still works but is slower because nothing is indexed.
  SVCS  4 | WSearch:2

tweak win.camerasvc | videocam_off | risk2
  name  Camera service off
  desc  Turns off the Windows camera frame server. Webcams stop working in every app until you turn it back on.
  SVCS  4 | FrameServer:3 FrameServerMonitor:3

tweak win.diagtrack | analytics | rec
  name  Telemetry service off
  desc  Stops the Connected User Experiences and Telemetry service and the WAP push service that feeds it.
  SVCS  4 | DiagTrack:2 dmwappushservice:3

tweak win.rdp | desktop_access_disabled
  name  Remote Desktop off
  desc  Turns off Remote Desktop, its redirection drivers and Windows Remote Management, so nobody can connect to this PC remotely.
  SVCS  4 | TermService:3 UmRdpService:3 WinRM:3 rdpbus rdpdr RdpVideominiport terminpt TsUsbFlt TsUsbGD tsusbhub

tweak win.hyperv | dns | risk2 reboot
  name  Hyper-V off
  desc  Turns off the hypervisor and the Hyper-V guest and host services. WSL2, Windows Sandbox, Android apps and virtual machines stop working until you turn it back on.
  SVCS  4 | HvHost:3 vmickvpexchange:3 vmicguestinterface:3 vmicshutdown:3 vmicheartbeat:3 vmicvmsession:3 vmicrdv:3 vmictimesync:3 vmicvss:3 Vid HvService HyperVideo gencounter hyperkbd vmgid vpci
  BCD   /set hypervisorlaunchtype off
  off:
  BCD   /set hypervisorlaunchtype auto

tweak win.phone | phone_disabled
  name  Telephony services off
  desc  Turns off the phone service and the automatic time zone from mobile networks. Only for PCs without a SIM card.
  SVCS  4 | PhoneSvc:3 autotimesvc:3

tweak win.bits | cloud_sync | risk2
  name  Background transfer service off
  desc  Turns off BITS. Windows Update and Store downloads stop, so only use it together with Turn off Windows Update.
  SVCS  4 | BITS:3

sub startup | Startup apps

tweak apps.startupoff | power_settings_new | risk2
  name  Startup apps off
  desc  Turns off every app that starts with Windows (the same switch as Task Manager's Startup apps page), so only what you open yourself runs. Windows Security, audio and touchpad helpers are kept. Switching it back on restores each app's previous state.
  STARTUPOFF SecurityHealth* *Realtek* RtkAud* *Synaptics* ETD* *Elan* *Touchpad* *Precision*

tweak apps.discordboot | power_settings_new | rec
  name  Discord at startup off
  desc  Stops Discord from starting with Windows. Open it yourself when you need it.
  R-    UCV\Run | Discord
  R     UCV\Explorer\StartupApproved\Run | Discord | b:030000000000000000000000 | -


sub remove | Remove apps

