tweak apps.store | storefront | risk3
  name  Remove Microsoft Store
  desc  Removes the Microsoft Store, Store purchases and the Windows Backup app, blocks the Store by policy and stops its install and licence services. Store apps you already have keep working until they need an update. Switching off unblocks the Store, but you need to reinstall it with winget or wsreset.
  A!    Microsoft.WindowsStore Microsoft.StorePurchaseApp Microsoft.WindowsBackup
  R     PM\WindowsStore | RemoveWindowsStore | d:1 | -
  R     PM\WindowsStore | DisableStoreApps | d:1 | -
  SVCS  4 | AppXSvc:3 ClipSVC:3 AppReadiness:3 LicenseManager:3 InstallService:3 PushToInstall:3
  T     disable \Microsoft\Windows\InstallService\
  T     disable \Microsoft\Windows\PushToInstall\
  T     disable \Microsoft\Windows\Subscription\

tweak apps.stepsrec | screen_record | rec
  name  Remove Steps Recorder
  desc  Removes the old Steps Recorder (psr.exe) capability, which Windows is retiring anyway.
  CAP   App.StepsRecorder~~~~0.0.1.0

tweak apps.a11ytools | accessibility_new | risk2
  name  Accessibility tools off
  desc  Disables Narrator, Magnifier, the On-Screen Keyboard, Voice Access and Live Captions by renaming their programs. Only for PCs where nobody needs them; switching off restores them.
  FILEOFF %SystemRoot%\System32\Narrator.exe
  FILEOFF %SystemRoot%\System32\Magnify.exe
  FILEOFF %SystemRoot%\System32\osk.exe
  FILEOFF %SystemRoot%\System32\VoiceAccess.exe
  FILEOFF %SystemRoot%\System32\LiveCaptions.exe

sub onedrive | OneDrive

tweak apps.onedrive | cloud_off | action risk2
  name  Remove OneDrive
  desc  First moves your Desktop, Documents, Pictures, Music and Videos back out of OneDrive into your profile, then uninstalls OneDrive, removes its tasks, sync roots, Explorer entry and startup items, and blocks it by policy. Files that are only in the cloud are not downloaded, so make sure they are synced first.
  KFRESTORE OneDrive
  KILL  OneDrive
  KILL  OneDrive.App
  KILL  FileCoAuth
  RUNREG HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall\OneDrive | UninstallString
  RUNREG HKLM\SOFTWARE\WOW6432Node\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall\OneDrive | UninstallString
  RUNREG UCV\Uninstall\OneDrive | UninstallString
  RUNGLOB %SystemRoot%\System32\OneDriveSetup.exe | /uninstall
  RUNGLOB %SystemRoot%\SysWOW64\OneDriveSetup.exe | /uninstall
  RUNGLOB %LOCALAPPDATA%\Microsoft\OneDrive\*\OneDriveSetup.exe | /uninstall
  A     Microsoft.OneDrive
  R     PW\OneDrive | DisableFileSyncNGSC | d:1 | -
  T     delete \Microsoft\Windows\OneDrive\
  T     delete \OneDrive*
  SVCS  4 | OneSyncSvc:2 OneSyncSvc_*
  SVCS  3 | cldflt:2
  DELFILE %SystemRoot%\System32\OneDriveSetup.exe
  DELFILE %SystemRoot%\SysWOW64\OneDriveSetup.exe
  DELDIR %ProgramData%\Microsoft OneDrive
  DELDIR %ProgramFiles%\Microsoft OneDrive
  DELDIR %ProgramFiles(x86)%\Microsoft OneDrive
  DELDIR %LOCALAPPDATA%\Microsoft\OneDrive
  DELDIR %LOCALAPPDATA%\Microsoft\OneDriveSetup
  DELDIR %SystemDrive%\Users\Default\AppData\Local\Microsoft\OneDrive
  DELDIR %SystemDrive%\Users\Default\AppData\Local\Microsoft\OneDriveSetup
  DELEMPTY %USERPROFILE%\OneDrive
  DELFILE %APPDATA%\Microsoft\Windows\Start Menu\Programs\OneDrive.lnk
  DELFILE %ProgramData%\Microsoft\Windows\Start Menu\Programs\OneDrive.lnk
  DELFILE %SystemDrive%\Users\Default\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Windows\Start Menu\Programs\OneDrive.lnk
  DELFILE %USERPROFILE%\Desktop\OneDrive.lnk
  K-    CV\Uninstall\OneDrive
  K-    HKLM\SOFTWARE\WOW6432Node\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall\OneDrive
  KMATCH CV\Explorer\SyncRootManager | OneDrive
  KMATCH UCV\Explorer\BannerStore | OneDrive
  KMATCH UCV\Explorer\AutoplayHandlers\Handlers | OneDrive
  K-    UCV\Explorer\Desktop\NameSpace\{018D5C66-4533-4307-9B53-224DE2ED1FE6}
  K-    HKU\.DEFAULT\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Explorer\Desktop\NameSpace\{018D5C66-4533-4307-9B53-224DE2ED1FE6}
  R     HKCU\Software\Classes\CLSID\{018D5C66-4533-4307-9B53-224DE2ED1FE6} | System.IsPinnedToNameSpaceTree | d:0 | -
  R     HKCU\Software\Classes\Wow6432Node\CLSID\{018D5C66-4533-4307-9B53-224DE2ED1FE6} | System.IsPinnedToNameSpaceTree | d:0 | -
  R-    HKCU\Environment | OneDrive
  RUNDEL OneDrive
  RUNDEL OneDriveSetup
  R-    CV\RunOnce | OneDriveSetup
  R-    CV\RunOnce | OneDrive
  R-    HKLM\SOFTWARE\WOW6432Node\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Run | OneDriveSetup
  ASETUP OneDrive|OneDriveSetup
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\mobsync.exe | Debugger | s:%SystemRoot%\System32\systray.exe | -
  REFRESH

sub xbox | Xbox & Game Bar

tweak apps.xbox | sports_esports | risk2
  name  Remove Xbox apps
  desc  Removes the Xbox app, Game Pass, Xbox Live, identity provider and gaming services, disables the Xbox services and stops "you need an app for ms-gamebar" pop-ups. Games from the Xbox app or Game Pass stop working; Steam and other launchers are not affected.
  A     Microsoft.XboxApp Microsoft.GamingApp Microsoft.XboxAppServices Microsoft.Xbox Microsoft.XboxGamePass Microsoft.XboxGamePassDialog Microsoft.XboxLive Microsoft.XboxIdentityProvider Microsoft.UWPXboxLiveEvents
  A     Microsoft.XboxGameOverlayFPS Microsoft.XboxGamingSupportSoftware Microsoft.XboxGameCallableUI Microsoft.XboxSpeechToTextOverlay
  SVCS  4 | XblAuthManager:3 XblGameSave:3 XboxNetApiSvc:3 XboxGipSvc:3 xbgm:3 GamingServices:2 GamingServicesNet:3 GamingServicesAlt
  T     disable \Microsoft\XblGameSave\XblGameSaveTask
  R     M\WindowsRuntime\ActivatableClassId\Microsoft.Xbox.GamingAI.Companion.Host.GamingCompanionHostOptions | ActivationType | d:4294967295 | -
  R     M\WindowsRuntime\ActivatableClassId\Microsoft.Xbox.GamingAI.Companion.Host.GamingCompanionHostOptions | Server | s: | -
  R     HKCR\ms-gamebar |  | s:URL:ms-gamebar | -
  R     HKCR\ms-gamebar | URL Protocol | s: | -
  R     HKCR\ms-gamebar\shell\open\command |  | s:%SystemRoot%\System32\systray.exe | -

tweak apps.gamebar | gamepad | risk2
  name  Remove Game Bar
  desc  Removes the Game Bar overlay and blocks it from starting. Win+G, Xbox party chat in the overlay and the Game Bar performance widgets stop working.
  A!    Microsoft.XboxGamingOverlay Microsoft.XboxGameOverlay Microsoft.Xbox.TCUI
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\GameBar.exe | Debugger | s:%WINDIR%\System32\taskkill.exe | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\GameBarFT.exe | Debugger | s:%WINDIR%\System32\taskkill.exe | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\GameBarFTServer.exe | Debugger | s:%WINDIR%\System32\taskkill.exe | -

sub cleaners | App cleaners

tweak apps.steamcache | cleaning_services | action
  name  Steam web cache
  desc  Closes Steam and clears its web and HTML caches, which fixes a slow or blank Steam store.
  KILL  steam
  DELDIR %ProgramFiles(x86)%\Steam\appcache\httpcache
  DELDIR %ProgramFiles(x86)%\Steam\config\htmlcache
  DELDIR %ProgramFiles%\Steam\appcache\httpcache
  DELDIR %ProgramFiles%\Steam\config\htmlcache

sub install | Install

tweak apps.runtimes | download | action
  name  Visual C++ & DirectX runtimes
  desc  Installs every Visual C++ redistributable from 2005 to the latest, the DirectX runtime and the .NET 8 desktop runtime, which older games and tools need. They come from Microsoft through winget, Windows' own package manager.
  WINGET Microsoft.VCRedist.2005.x86
  WINGET Microsoft.VCRedist.2005.x64 | x64
  WINGET Microsoft.VCRedist.2008.x86
  WINGET Microsoft.VCRedist.2008.x64 | x64
  WINGET Microsoft.VCRedist.2010.x86
  WINGET Microsoft.VCRedist.2010.x64 | x64
  WINGET Microsoft.VCRedist.2012.x86
  WINGET Microsoft.VCRedist.2012.x64 | x64
  WINGET Microsoft.VCRedist.2013.x86
  WINGET Microsoft.VCRedist.2013.x64 | x64
  WINGET Microsoft.VCRedist.2015+.x86
  WINGET Microsoft.VCRedist.2015+.x64 | x64
  WINGET Microsoft.DirectX
  WINGET Microsoft.DotNet.DesktopRuntime.8

tweak apps.openshell | start | action
  name  Open-Shell Start menu
  desc  Installs Open-Shell through winget and sets it up with a clean dark classic Start menu, no web search, no tracking of recent programs and no update checks.
  WINGET Open-Shell.Open-Shell-Menu
  R     HKLM\SOFTWARE\OpenShell\OpenShell | Update | d:0 | -
  R     HKCU\Software\OpenShell\StartMenu | ShowedStyle2 | d:1 | -
  OSHELL RecentPrograms=s:None RecentMetroApps=0 EnableJumplists=0 HybridShutdown=0 StartScreenShortcut=0 AutoStart=1 HighlightNew=0 HighlightNewApps=0 ShiftClick=s:ClassicMenu ShiftWin=s:ClassicMenu CheckWinUpdates=0
  OSHELL SearchTrack=0 SearchAutoComplete=0 SearchPath=0 SearchMetroApps=0 SearchMetroSettings=0 SearchKeywords=0 SearchSubWord=0 SearchFiles=0 SearchContents=0 SearchCategories=0 SearchInternet=0 MoreResults=0
  OSHELL MainMenuAnimate=0 NumericSort=0 FontSmoothing=s:None MenuShadow=0 EnableGlass=0 GlassOverride=1 GlassColor=2039583 SkinW7=s:Immersive SkinVariationW7=s: SkipMetro=1 NoSearchBox=1 PreCacheIcons=0 EnableAccelerators=0
  OSHELL CustomTaskbar=1 TaskbarLook=s:Opaque TaskbarColor=1315860
  R     HKCU\Software\OpenShell\StartMenu\Settings | SkinOptionsW7 | m:LIGHT=0\0DARK=1\0AUTO=0\0USER_IMAGE=0\0USER_NAME=0\0CENTER_NAME=0\0SMALL_ICONS=1\0OPAQUE=1\0DISABLE_MASK=0\0BLACK_TEXT=0\0BLACK_FRAMES=0\0TRANSPARENT_LESS=0\0TRANSPARENT_MORE=0 | -
  R     UCV\Explorer\Advanced | TaskbarAl | d:1 | -

