tweak apps.edgedebloat | tune | rec
  name  Edge clean-up
  desc  If you keep Edge: no startup boost, sidebar, shopping assistant, Rewards, Discover, search suggestions, web widget, first-run tour or default-browser nag, and no sync or personalization reporting.
  POLICY PM\Edge | StartupBoostEnabled=0 HubsSidebarEnabled=0 EdgeShoppingAssistantEnabled=0 ShowMicrosoftRewards=0 PersonalizationReportingEnabled=0 SyncDisabled=1 DefaultBrowserSettingEnabled=0 SearchSuggestEnabled=0 EdgeDiscoverEnabled=0 WebWidgetAllowed=0 HideFirstRunExperience=1

